Verse 1:
[G]Lord Jesus, [D]I [G]long to be [D7]perfectly [G]whole;
[G]I want Thee [D]for[G]ever to [D7]live in my [G]soul;
[G]Break down every [C]idol, cast out every [G]foe;
[G]Now wash me, and I shall be [D7]whiter than [G]snow.
[D7]Whiter than snow, [Em]yes, whiter [C]than [G]snow;
[G]Now [C]wash me, and [G]I shall be [D7]whiter than [G]snow.

Refrain:
[G]Whiter [D]than [G]snow, yes, [D7]whiter [G]than snow;
[G]Now wash [D]me, and [G]I shall [D7]be whiter [G]than snow.

Verse 2:
[G]Lord Jesus, [D]look down [G]from Thy [D7]throne in [G]the skies,
[G]And [D]help me [G]to [D7]make a [G]complete sacrifice;
[G]I give [C]up myself, and [G]whatever I know;
[G]Now wash me, [D7]and I shall [G]be whiter than snow.

Verse 3:
[G]Lord [D]Jesus, for [G]this [D7]I most [G]humbly entreat;
[G]I [D]wait, blessed [G]Lord, [D7]at Thy [G]crucified feet,
[G]By faith, for [C]my cleansing; I [G]see Thy blood flow;
[G]Now wash me, [D7]and I shall [G]be whiter than snow.

Verse 4:
[G]Lord [D]Jesus, [G]Thou seest [D7]I [G]patiently wait;
[G]Come [D]now, and [G]within me [D7]a new [G]heart create;
[G]To those [C]who have [G]sought Thee,
[G]Thou [D7]never [G]said'st No;
[D7]Now wash [Em]me, and I [C]shall be [G]whiter than snow.
